---
import Layout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PlainSpeakModal from "../components/PlainSpeakModal.astro";
import "../styles/policies.css";
---

<Layout title="Cookies Policy | Mind Arc Games">
  <main class="policy-page">
    <div class="policy-shell">
      <section class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Mind Arc Games</p>
        <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle">
          Mind Arc Network, Games, and Online Services
        </p>
        <p class="last-updated">Last Updated: August 12, 2026</p>
        <button type="button" class="plain-speak-link" data-plain-speak-open>
          Written under our Plain Speak Doctrine
        </button>
      </section>

      <section class="policy-panel">
        <p>Cookies sound more complicated than they really are.</p>

        <p>
          A cookie is a small piece of information that a website stores in your
          browser. Websites use cookies for many different reasons, such as
          keeping you signed in, remembering settings, improving security, or
          understanding how a website is being used.
        </p>

        <p>
          This Cookie Policy explains how <strong>Mind Arc Games</strong> uses cookies
          and similar browser technologies across our websites and online services.
        </p>

        <h2>What Is a Cookie?</h2>

        <p>
          A cookie is a small piece of data stored by your web browser when you
          visit a website.
        </p>

        <p>
          Cookies can help a website remember information between page visits or
          between visits to the website.
        </p>

        <p>
          For example, a cookie can help a website remember that you already
          signed in so you do not have to sign in again every time you open
          another page.
        </p>

        <p>Not all cookies are used for advertising or tracking.</p>

        <h2>How Mind Arc Games Uses Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Mind Arc Games currently uses cookies and similar browser technologies
          mainly to support essential website and account features.
        </p>

        <p>These features may include:</p>

        <ul>
          <li>Keeping you signed in to your Mind Arc Network account.</li>
          <li>
            Maintaining your account session while you move between pages.
          </li>
          <li>Helping protect account and authentication features.</li>
          <li>
            Allowing protected games and services to recognize that you are
            signed in.
          </li>
          <li>Remembering certain settings or preferences when needed.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Essential Cookies</h2>

        <p>
          Some cookies are necessary for a website feature to work properly. We
          call these <strong>essential cookies</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          For example, when you sign in to the Mind Arc Network, your browser
          needs a way to maintain information about that signed-in session.
        </p>

        <p>
          If those cookies are blocked or deleted, you may be signed out or
          certain account features may stop working.
        </p>

        <p>
          We do not treat essential cookies as an advertising choice because
          they are used to provide features you have asked to use.
        </p>

        <h2>Analytics and Advertising</h2>

        <p>
          Mind Arc Games may introduce analytics, advertising, or other optional
          technologies as our games and online services develop.
        </p>

        <p>
          These technologies can work differently from essential cookies. For
          example, some may be used to measure website activity, understand how
          a feature is used, or support advertising.
        </p>

        <p>
          If we begin using optional cookies or similar technologies that
          require your permission, we will update this policy and provide
          appropriate choices when required.
        </p>

        <h2>Services Provided by Other Companies</h2>

        <p>
          Some parts of Mind Arc Games services are provided with the help of
          other companies.
        </p>

        <p>
          For example, account authentication, website hosting, email delivery,
          analytics, payments, or other online features may involve outside
          service providers.
        </p>

        <p>
          Some of these services may use cookies or similar browser technologies
          when necessary to provide their features.
        </p>

        <p>
          Our <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> explains more about how Mind Arc
          Games and other service providers may handle information.
        </p>

        <h2>Managing Cookies in Your Browser</h2>

        <p>
          Most web browsers allow you to view, delete, or block cookies through
          the browser's privacy or security settings.
        </p>

        <p>
          You are free to change those settings, but blocking cookies may
          prevent some Mind Arc Games features from working properly.
        </p>

        <p>
          In particular, deleting or blocking cookies used for authentication
          may sign you out of your Mind Arc Network account.
        </p>

        <h2>Cookie Choices</h2>

        <p>
          If Mind Arc Games uses optional cookies that require a choice, we may
          provide controls that allow you to accept, reject, or manage those
          cookies.
        </p>

        <p>
          Essential cookies may remain active when they are needed to provide a
          feature you choose to use.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>

        <p>
          Mind Arc Games will continue to develop new games, account features,
          and online services. Our use of cookies may change as those services
          change.
        </p>

        <p>
          When we make meaningful changes to this Cookie Policy, we will update
          the
          <strong>Last Updated</strong> date shown at the top of the page.
        </p>

        <p>
          If a change requires additional notice or permission under applicable
          law, we will provide it.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>

        <p>
          If you have questions about this Cookie Policy or how Mind Arc Games
          uses cookies, you are welcome to contact us.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-card">
          <p><strong>Mind Arc Games</strong></p>

          <p>
            Email:
            <a href="mailto:contact@mindarcgames.com">
              contact@mindarcgames.com
            </a>
          </p>

          <p>
            Website:
            <a
              href="https://mindarcgames.com"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >
              mindarcgames.com
            </a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
  <PlainSpeakModal />
</Layout>
